<title>MEXICO: Fleming says upgrades ICA to speculative buy.</title>
<headline>Fleming says upgrades ICA to speculative buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming Research said it had upgraded construction firm Empresas ICA to speculative buy from hold, saying this reflected an improved fundamental outlook for the sector and a recent depreciation of the ICA stock price.  </p>
<p>Analyst Ben Uglow predicted 1997 earnings per ADR of 70 cents but said he had lowered his EPADR prediction for this year to 36 cents from 61 cents in response to lower than expected third quarter results.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9551</p>
